      },
      {
        "id": "E2",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "Enterprise administrators can now require supported GitHub Copilot clients to retrieve current server-managed settings at startup instead of relying on a cached policy.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://github.blog/changelog/2026-10-13-enterprise-managed-settings-enforcement-updates",
        "source": "GitHub Changelog",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-13T15:20:10.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-14T23:57:21.118Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E3",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "We are also adding minimum client version requirements to governance-focused managed settings keys over time, starting with the sandbox key.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://github.blog/changelog/2026-10-13-enterprise-managed-settings-enforcement-updates",
        "source": "GitHub Changelog",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-13T15:20:10.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-14T23:57:21.118Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E4",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "Force refresh settings on client startup",
        "sourceUrl": "https://github.blog/changelog/2026-10-13-enterprise-managed-settings-enforcement-updates",
        "source": "GitHub Changelog",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-13T15:20:10.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-14T23:57:21.118Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E5",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "Set forceRemoteSettingsRefresh to true through server-managed, MDM-managed, or file-based settings when a policy change must take effect before Copilot starts.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://github.blog/changelog/2026-10-13-enterprise-managed-settings-enforcement-updates",
        "source": "GitHub Changelog",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-13T15:20:10.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-14T23:57:21.118Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E6",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "The setting is supported in Copilot CLI, VS Code, and the GitHub Copilot app.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://github.blog/changelog/2026-10-13-enterprise-managed-settings-enforcement-updates",
        "source": "GitHub Changelog",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-13T15:20:10.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-14T23:57:21.118Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E7",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "MDM-managed and file-based delivery can require freshness before the client signs in for the first time.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://github.blog/changelog/2026-10-13-enterprise-managed-settings-enforcement-updates",
        "source": "GitHub Changelog",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-13T15:20:10.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-14T23:57:21.118Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E8",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "We&rsquo;ve also added enforcement of a required minimum client version to the sandbox key in support of the generally available local sandbox capability.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://github.blog/changelog/2026-10-13-enterprise-managed-settings-enforcement-updates",
        "source": "GitHub Changelog",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-13T15:20:10.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-14T23:57:21.118Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E9",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "When this key is included in managed settings, users who pin to older versions of Copilot clients will now be forced to update in order to resume using Copilot.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://github.blog/changelog/2026-10-13-enterprise-managed-settings-enforcement-updates",
        "source": "GitHub Changelog",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-13T15:20:10.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-14T23:57:21.118Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E10",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "To learn more, see Deploying enterprise managed settings .",
        "sourceUrl": "https://github.blog/changelog/2026-10-13-enterprise-managed-settings-enforcement-updates",
        "source": "GitHub Changelog",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-13T15:20:10.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-14T23:57:21.118Z"
      },
      {
